+
+| Check | Original application | Repaired application |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| selection | PASS, exhaustive bound 6 | PASS, exhaustive bound 6 |
+| reuse_iff | FAIL, concrete counterexample | PASS, exhaustive bound 6 |
+| recompute | FAIL, concrete counterexample | PASS, exhaustive bound 6 |
+| Starter ExUnit test | 1 passed | 1 passed |
+| Exit code | 1 | 0 |
+
+The successful check regenerated the model from the repaired Elixir source:
+`29764b41524f7f15a8ccbc8df303d1962e509e53820133cfdc53b47e910d43d8`.
+The authoritative broker completed regeneration, all law checks, and the
+starter test in 12.945 seconds. The broker generates and checks its own copy;
+the visible generated starter snapshots were not hand-edited.
+
+`sha256sum -c fixed.sha256` confirmed `laws.json` and
+`verification/laws.qnt` are unchanged. The contract and public API manifest
+were also left unchanged.
+
+Verification establishes every prefix of zero through six events in the fixed
+two-tree, two-context event domain. No proof or tooling limitation was reported.
